  "interpretation": "<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2742\">Elevated or deficient levels may indicate:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2899\">\n<li data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2778\">\n<p data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2778\">Inborn errors of metabolism</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2852\">\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2852\">CNS disorders (e.g., nonketotic hyperglycinemia, phenylketonuria)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2899\">\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2899\">Neurodegenerative/metabolic conditions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2899\">Clinical correlation is essential with plasma amino acid profile, urine organic acids, enzyme studies, and genetic panels.</p>",
